Package: pgscompare
Type: Package
Title: Combine, Evaluate and Compare Many Polygenic Scores on AnVIL/Terra
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "msethpeacock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a Terra data table of per-PGS score files (raw plink2 .sscore
    and ancestry-adjusted), merges them with phenotypes, evaluates every score
    with 'pgsmetrics' (plus a per-SD odds ratio), enriches results with PGS
    Catalog metadata and reported performance, and produces comparison plots
    (metrics vs. ancestry / sample size / variants / match rate, adjusted vs.
    raw, yours vs. PGS Catalog, odds-ratio summaries, population vs.
    sub-population).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
